// Markdown lint configuration for security-program-templates.
//
// These documents are prose meant to be read and adapted, not source code.
// They are written one sentence per line so that a diff shows which sentence
// changed rather than reflowing a paragraph, and sentences here are long. Hard
// wrapping at 80 characters would make every edit produce a paragraph-sized
// diff and would break the wide reference tables the templates rely on, so the
// line-length rule is off deliberately rather than by neglect.
//
// Everything else markdownlint checks is left on and is expected to pass.
{
  "config": {
    "default": true,
    "MD013": false
  },
  "globs": ["**/*.md"],
  "ignores": ["node_modules/**"]
}
